{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1000_p", "source_sha256": "837a77bbf2f95526879135691e81d3825a2141f21cb1ffb2801722bd5e2cf904", "ja": "（今日は『アイグラ！！』のグラビア企画で、紗代子の\n撮影をしにきた。そろそろ準備が終わる頃だが……）", "zh": "（今天是来参加『アイグラ！！』写真企划，为纱代子进行拍摄的。差不多该准备好了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "9d54e9bb4071cf793b9c3ff940453ef70bed921fbd854bad28f3ef3e96d9b181", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}！\n着替え終わりましたけど、どうでしょうか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我已经换好衣服了，您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8dd0c4499367342be23fd0ac3d9b5bbf763178845663a7231f413df63da7ad5b", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。\nすごく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，紗代子。\n非常适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "19a0a25150e50498fa5ddd080598bdfd4c48ccf4373235bd9d5f833cac9796cc", "ja": "本当ですか！　ありがとうございます♪　せっかく\n選んでいただいた衣装なので、上手く着こなしたくて。", "zh": "真的吗！谢谢您♪ 难得是您为我挑选的服装，我想把它穿得更好看一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "4b161391516799ec3b90e327b9ec8bf530300829bef81e7d2a44c6102140a127", "ja": "チャイナ服ですから、動きのあるポーズとか\n合いそうですよね！　ちょっとやってみようかな……？", "zh": "既然是旗袍，摆一些活泼的姿势应该很合适吧！要不要试试看……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "7191ecddbc4d9d8ffaf71abff1a552077f44dd1b28f41debe8a5b9838ff6c67c", "ja": "あ、でも……。\n…………。", "zh": "啊，不过……\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1006_p", "source_sha256": "12a4fc483ecd0daf2acc81a2c9822a6ac75c13dce126568f86b18cf5f4ac4964", "ja": "……紗代子？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "……纱代子？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "6f998bc111c83875f0e71562dbf13ba5315887416945dacf0010ea403fa02a64", "ja": "い、いえ。この衣装、結構大胆だなって思って……。\nスリットがあって、動くと脚とかも見えそうですし。", "zh": "没、没什么。我只是觉得这套服装还挺大胆的……有开衩，动起来的话，腿什么的也会露出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1008_p", "source_sha256": "af8d33a96cc8e9a2f6060fd5bd3b2e3ddc8d7a74ddcc3d5a5fdb655f8ccb1b3d", "ja": "そうだな。セクシーで、いいと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。很性感，我觉得挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "668558cda04af2761c52324d2772991383708354d25025c48eff4ad42f4e25aa", "ja": "セ、セクシー……なんでしょうか？\n私は、あまり意識していなかったんですが……。", "zh": "性、性感……是这样吗？\n我之前倒是没怎么在意……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "fa6f169998ed934e43034f74f8d6c61f82d6731aa6e43db16b5c1edfb6013fe2", "ja": "でも、何というか、一度気づくと、\nつい意識してしまいますね……。あはは。", "zh": "不过，该怎么说呢，一旦注意到了，就会不由自主地在意起来呢……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "58ba49e5abc81540d5389db2f8a2606bdd007affc0ffc374ee7536f454068857", "ja": "な、なんだかすごく恥ずかしくなってきました……！\nどうしましょう、{$P$}……！", "zh": "不、不知怎么的，突然觉得好害羞……！\n怎么办啊，{$P$}……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2e7c4e58557b6107fedbec28769dcca9f252af48d834af9d398be0040d945ded", "ja": "うーん……よし、まずは、肩の力を抜こう！\n大丈夫、似合っているのは本当だから。", "zh": "嗯……好，首先，放松肩膀吧！\n没关系，你穿着确实很合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3cb0a53922fa82a85bcb6a952225ea62f30b78a782f63c7c230434aac16ca386", "ja": "意識すると、恥ずかしいかもしれないけど……。\n逆に言えば、しなければいいんだ！", "zh": "一旦意识到这件事，可能会觉得害羞……  \n反过来说，不去想就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "1c26d68c608dc49c3535f72a97812f97b1e1cf3657848bd475381da8afc8865e", "ja": "しなければいい……なるほど！\nつまり、一度全部忘れてしまえばいいんですね！？", "zh": "不去做就好了……原来如此！\n也就是说，只要把一切暂时忘掉就行了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6a07ec918c1bb771ac325da46140e64649294a843e214298b6e791b7b57566b8", "ja": "そう！　自然体で臨めば、\n紗代子なら、きっといい写真が撮れるはずだ！", "zh": "没错！保持自然状态的话，纱代子一定能拍出好照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "eaa1710c1e71a4be48a3cc9bf7e00ffedd0ad2bf675979dd6295a3294eec980c", "ja": "わかりました！　つまり、普段通りでいいんですよね。\nそういうことなら私、全力で撮影に挑みます！", "zh": "我明白了！也就是说，和平时一样就行了对吧。\n既然是这样，那我一定会全力以赴投入拍摄的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "6b95099c593e2044d748530958ce37084ab0e28b835e6108c0f413545d2dfeb9", "ja": "{$P$}の期待や、いただいた衣装に\n応えられるよう、最高の一枚にしてみせますね！", "zh": "为了不辜负{$P$}的期待和您为我准备的服装，\n我一定会拍出一张最棒的照片给您看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0193_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1d8258a8d7a8253c0b9c0011fa4451ec874badef4f12d9c2ba189397ec71ab0a", "ja": "（結果、普段の紗代子とチャイナ服の魅力が合わさった\n最高の写真が撮れたようだ。やったな、紗代子！）", "zh": "（结果，平时的纱代子与旗袍的魅力相结合，似乎拍出了一张最棒的照片。干得漂亮，纱代子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
